  type: 'principle',
  domain: 'software-engineering',
  pattern_data: JSON.stringify({
    embedding,
    pattern: { principle: 'fail-fast with clear errors' }
  }),
  confidence: 0.95,
  // ...
});
```

### Multi-Domain Learning

Transfer learning across domains:

```typescript
